#: kcmkonsole.cpp:163
msgid ""
"<h1>Konsole</h1> With this module you can configure Konsole, the KDE "
"terminal application. You can configure the generic Konsole options (which "
"can also be configured using the RMB) and you can edit the schemas and "
"sessions available to Konsole."
msgstr ""
"<h1>Konsole </h1> Vo+'i module na`y, ba.n co' the^? ca^'u hi`nh Konsole, u+'ng du.ng"
"dda^`u cuo^'i cu?a KDE . Ba.n co' the^? ca^'u hi`nh ca'c tuy` cho.n chung cu?a Konsole "
"(ca'i na`y cu~ng co' the^? ddu+o+.c ca^'u hi`nh du`ng RMB) va` ba.n co' the^? su+?a "
"ca'c ke^' hoa.ch ( schemas) va` ca'c bie^'n session cho Konsole ."

